    "id": "ctk:b04dbab4a24decf45c33bb31",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "系统的传递函数可以通过设形如 y(t)=H(s)e^{st} 的解，代入微分方程并求解 H(s) 来求得；也可以在零初始条件下对微分方程取拉普拉斯变换，并求比值 Y(s)/U(s) 来求得。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The transfer function of a system can be found by assuming a solution of the form y(t)=H(s)e^{st}, substituting into the differential equation, and solving for H(s), or by taking the Laplace transform of the differential equation with zero initial conditions and forming the ratio Y(s)/U(s).",
